 {request}←header SetHeader request;i
⍝ Adds `header`, a name-value pair, to `request.Headers`.
⍝ If a header of that name is already there (names are not case sensitive) its value is replaced.\\
⍝ `request` is a namespace that callers often send more than once, so simply appending would add
⍝ the same header again with every request.
 i←(⎕C⊃¨request.Headers)⍳⊂⎕C⊃header
 :If i>≢request.Headers
     request.Headers,←⊂header
 :Else
     request.Headers[i]←⊂header
 :EndIf
⍝Done
